Jazzpunk is not; aesthetically pleasing, deep story wise, clever or innovative. What Jazzpunk is, is a crazy roller-coaster that you won’t experience anywhere else. Not to mention hysterical and relentless with how many jokes it throws at its player. It is comedic interactive experience that is wonderfully memorable. If you like that type of irreverent comedy then Jazzpunk is the game for you.
